{"channelId":"UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","row":["Chiropractic Ortho Neuro Physio",17,"**Welcome to Chiropractic Ortho Neuro Physio Clinic, Ghaziabad**\n\nAt *Chiropractic Ortho Neuro Physio Clinic*, we specialize in **advanced non-surgical spine care** to help you live a pain-free and active life. Our mission is to provide safe, effective, and evidence-based treatment for spine and joint-related problems without surgery.\n\n we focus on treating conditions like:\n✔️ Slip Disc (Herniated Disc)\n✔️ Sciatica Pain\n✔️ Chronic Back & Neck Pain\n✔️ Cervical & Lumbar Spondylosis\n✔️ Shoulder, Knee & Joint Pain\n✔️ Posture Disorders\n\nOn this channel, you’ll find:\n🎥 Real patient recovery stories\n🎥 Spine health education & awareness\n🎥 Effective exercises & posture tips\n🎥 Non-surgical treatment demonstrations\n🎥 Expert advice for pain relief\n\nIf you’re struggling with pain and want a **natural, non-surgical solution**, this channel is for you.\n\n📍 *Location:* Ghaziabad, India\n📞 *Book Appointment:* +91-9643646861\n #chiropracticorthoneurophysio \n #chiropractor  #orthoneurophysioclinic","orthoneurophysiotherapyclinic@gmail.com","India"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:35.741Z","channelId":"UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"49791ba85de1a9bc274f01a5261ba023f75d6b43f8676b2e0eeafcfc1a942635","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5235b71b0a75431585bf0984b821a1e6c29b388a18d40a81d6b226997f83ff45"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:35.741Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKkRmyBZQN_u5OUOBNbZTRg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":17,"raw":"17 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKkRmyBZQN_u